### Example environment variables (DO NOT commit real secrets)
# Put a real `.env` in your local environment (it's ignored by .gitignore)

# Google reCAPTCHA secret (server-side only)
RECAPTCHA_SECRET=your_recaptcha_secret_here

# Optional: Formspree / email endpoint if you proxy submissions through a serverless function
FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# Any other third-party secret keys (Stripe, Mailgun, AWS) go here
#STRIPE_SECRET=sk_test_xxx
